(comment hasAssociatedRangeCollection "(#$hasAssociatedRangeCollection COLL ONTOLOGY PRED RANGE-COLL) means that RANGE-COLL is the corresponding collection used as an arg2Isa for the OWLProperty PRED in ONTOLOGY that has specs (or instances) of COLL as its range.")
(comment careEventHasPreOpStatusExplanation "<code>(#$careEventHasPreOpStatusExplanation SURG-OR-OP STAT-TYPE)</code> means that <code>SURG-OR-OP</code> is associated with the surgery type <code>STAT-TYPE</code> in one of the following ways:
<p>
1. <code>SURG-OR-OP</code> is a surgical procedure contained by an operation that has the status explanation <code>STAT-TYPE</code>;<br>
or<br>
2. <code>SURG-OR-OP</code> is an operation that has the status explanation<code>STAT-TYPE</code>")
(comment medicalEventHasPreOpPatientStatus "<code>(#$medicalEventHasPreOpPatientStatus SURG-OR-OP STAT-TYPE)</code> means that <code>SURG-OR-OP</code> is associated with the surgery type <code>STAT-TYPE</code> in one of the following ways:
<p>
1. <code>SURG-OR-OP</code> is a surgical procedure contained by an operation that also has the patient preop status <code>STAT-TYPE</code>;<br>
or<br>
2. <code>SURG-OR-OP</code> is an operation that has the paitent preop status <code>STAT-TYPE</code>.")
