(comment Grant "The collection of all grants, which are specifications of how a particular allotment of money is to be used. A type of the union of { cooperative agreements, grants } and #$EconomicAgreement. The concept #$Grant is an #$AwardInstrumentType, a (#$CollectionUnionFn (#$TheSet #$FacetInstanceCollection #$ClarifyingCollectionType)), and a #$ConventionalClassificationType.")
(comment Eagle "The collection of all eagles. A type of #$AccipitrineFamily. #$Eagle is an #$OrganismClassificationType.")
(comment Pod "The collection of all pods. A type of #$Container.")
(comment Pinnacle "The collection of all pinnacles. A type of #$TopSide.")
(comment Pigeon "The collection of all pigeons. A type of #$Bird. #$Pigeon constitutes a #$BiologicalFamily.")
(comment LeviathanQuery "A type of #$CycLQuerySpecification. The concept #$LeviathanQuery is a #$LeviathanQueryType and a #$NonAbducibleCollection.")
(comment Partisan "The collection of all partisans. A type of #$HomoSapiens.")
(comment Husk "The collection of all husks. A type of #$SolidTangibleArtifact.")
(comment ComputerDisplayScreenRegion "The collection of all connected regions on an active computer screen. A type of #$SurfaceRegion-Bounded, #$InformationBearingObject, #$SurfaceRegion-Finite, #$StillImageSource, and #$SurfaceRegion-Tangible. #$ComputerDisplayScreenRegion is a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType.")
(comment Professorship "The collection of all professorships. A type of #$JobPosition.")
(comment Catheterization " The collection of all actions in which a catheter is inserted into a vessel in the body. A type of #$PuttingSomethingIntoSomething. #$Catheterization is a #$SkilledActivityType.")
(comment EyeglassLens "The collection of all eyeglass lenses. A type of #$Lens-Artificial. The concept #$EyeglassLens is an #$ArtifactTypeByGenericCategory and a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType.")
(comment Godfather "The collection of all godfathers. A type of #$AdultMaleHuman.")
(comment Separatist "The collection of all separatists. A type of #$HomoSapiens.")
(comment MuslimSeparatist "The collection of all muslim separatists. A type of #$Separatist.")
(comment Psychotherapist "The collection of all psychotherapists. A type of #$Psychologist.")
(comment CornHusk "The collection of all corn husks. A type of #$Husk.")
(comment Bottleneck "The collection of all bottlenecks. A type of #$Congestion.")
(comment NonCommissionedOfficer "The collection of all non-commissioned officers in military services. A type of #$EnlistedPerson and #$MilitaryOfficer. #$NonCommissionedOfficer is a #$PersonTypeByPositionInOrg.")
(comment Vulture "The collection of all vultures. A type of #$Scavenger and #$Bird. #$Vulture is an #$OrganismClassificationType.")
(comment Novice "The collection of all novices. A type of #$HomoSapiens.")
(comment Booklet "The collection of all booklets. A type of #$PublishedConceptualWork.")
(comment RetiredPersonDrawingAPension "The collection of all retired people who draw a regular pension. A type of #$RetiredPerson.")
(comment Goggles "The collection of all goggles, protective gear for the wearer's eyes. A type of #$Eyewear, #$PhysicalImpactBuffer, and #$ProtectiveAttire. The concept #$Goggles is an #$ArtifactTypeByGenericCategory and a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType.")
(comment Manure "The collection of all manure. A type of #$Feces.")
(comment HMO-StaffModel "The collection of all staff model HMOs. A type of #$HealthMaintenanceOrganization. #$HMO-StaffModel is an #$HMOModelType.")
(comment HMO-GroupModel "The collection of all group model HMOs. A type of #$HealthMaintenanceOrganization. #$HMO-GroupModel is an #$HMOModelType.")
(comment HMOAffiliate "The collection of all HMO affiliates -- suborganizations of HMO corporations. A type of #$HealthMaintenanceOrganization.")
(comment HMOModelType "The collection of all model type HMOs. A type of #$ConventionalClassificationType. The concept #$HMOModelType is a #$SiblingDisjointSetOrCollectionType.")
(comment HMO-NetworkModel "The collection of all network model HMOs. A type of #$HealthMaintenanceOrganization. #$HMO-NetworkModel is an #$HMOModelType.")
(comment ProperNoun "The collection of all proper nouns. A type of #$PhrasalWordForm and #$Noun. #$ProperNoun is a #$SpeechPart.")
(comment HMO-IPAModel "The collection of all Independent Practice Association model HMOs. A type of #$HealthMaintenanceOrganization. #$HMO-IPAModel is an #$HMOModelType.")
(comment MailScam "The collection of all mail scams. A type of #$Scam.")
(comment Scam "The collection of all scams. A type of #$Deceiving.")
(comment LexicalDataMicrotheory "The collection of all microtheories that contain lexical assertions. A type of #$LexicalMicrotheory and #$DataMicrotheory. #$LexicalDataMicrotheory is a #$MicrotheoryType.")
(comment OutpatientMedicalCareEvent "The collection of all routine (not emergency) outpatient (not in hospital) medical care events. A type of #$MedicalProcedure. #$OutpatientMedicalCareEvent is a #$LearnedActivityType.")
(comment BloodPressureTest "The collection of all blood pressure tests. A type of #$MedicalTesting. #$BloodPressureTest is a #$LearnedActivityType.")
(comment LdlCholesterol "The collection of all LDL cholesterol. A type of #$Cholesterol.")
(comment RoofingSlate "The collection of all sheets of slate rock used for making roofs. A type of #$Shingle-BuildingMaterial and #$ConvexTangibleObject. The concept #$RoofingSlate is an #$ArtifactTypeByGenericCategory and a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType.")
(comment LeviathanQuery-Training "The collection of all queries that are part of some training test suite for Project Leviathan. A type of #$LeviathanQuery. The concept #$LeviathanQuery-Training is a #$LeviathanQueryType and a #$NonAbducibleCollection.")
(comment Ruler-MeasuringDevice "The collection of all rulers. A type of #$DistanceMeasuringDevice. The concept #$Ruler-MeasuringDevice is an #$ArtifactTypeByGenericCategory and a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType.")
(comment TapeMeasure "The collection of all tape measures. A type of #$DistanceMeasuringDevice. The concept #$TapeMeasure is an #$ArtifactTypeByGenericCategory and a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType.")
(comment DistanceMeasuringDevice "The collection of all devices that can be used to measure distances. A type of #$MeasuringDevice. #$DistanceMeasuringDevice is a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType.")
(comment Spectacle "The collection of all spectacles. A type of #$VisualImage.")
(comment RoadMap "The collection of all maps of geographical regions which show the roads of that region. A type of #$Map.")
(comment AmyotrophicLateralSclerosis "The collection of all cases of amyotrophic lateral sclerosis, also known as 'Lou Gehrig's Disease'.  A type of #$ChronicCondition, #$AilmentCondition, and #$LifeThreateningCondition. #$AmyotrophicLateralSclerosis is a #$PhysiologicalConditionType.")
(comment Hospital-NonProfit "The collection of all hospitals operated on a not-for-profit basis. A type of #$Hospital and #$NonProfitOrganization.")
(comment LexicalProblemSolvingContext "The collection of all lexical problem-solving contexts. A type of #$ProblemSolvingCntxt and #$LexicalMicrotheory-NonLexWiz. #$LexicalProblemSolvingContext is a #$MicrotheoryType.")
(comment Arbitrator "The collection of all arbitrators. A type of #$JudicialAgent.")
(comment Hospital-Profit "The collection of all for-profit hospitals. A type of #$Hospital and #$ServiceEstablishment. #$Hospital-Profit is a #$BusinessTypeByActivityType.")
(comment ManualTypewriter "The collection of all manual (not electrically powered) typewriters. A type of #$Typewriter. The concept #$ManualTypewriter is an #$ArtifactTypeByGenericCategory and a #$SpatiallyDisjointObjectType.")
(comment CholesterolTest "The collection of all blood tests that result in a measurement of the cholesterol level.  A type of #$ParameterTest and #$BloodTest. The concept #$CholesterolTest is a #$TermForExampleOWLExport, a #$SkilledActivityType, and a #$DisjointMedicalSituationType.")
(comment Plight "The collection of all plights. A type of #$Dilemma.")
(comment Re-election "The collection of all re-elections. A type of #$Election.")
(comment FracturedBoneXRayTest "The collection of all x-ray tests to determine if a bone is fractured. A type of #$XRayTest. The concept #$FracturedBoneXRayTest is a #$DisjointMedicalSituationType and a #$SkilledActivityType.")
(comment SurfaceLayer-TopSurface "The collection of all top surface layers of objects which entirely cover the tops of the objects, e.g., table top surfaces, or the surface of a body of water.  It excludes undersides.  The 'top' surface is the highest-up surface of the uppermost parts of a SpatialThing when it is in its normal position; if the top is curved, like the back of a pig, the top surface includes the skin over the backbone and an indefinite amount of surrounding skin. The top surface of a body of water (like a lake) is the surface exposed to the air. (See also #$EntireSurfaceLayer.)")
(comment correspondingIntegerExtent "Use this predicate to relate instances of #$NLGenQuantAttribute to the appropriate instance of #$NonNegativeIntegerRange.")
(comment RightRiverbank "The collection of right bank of a river. See #$RightRiverbankFn.")
